  kind: 1
  title: Fried Eggs and Potatoes
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Fried Eggs and Potatoes


    One
    potato, cubed

    Two eggs

    A pinch of salt


    Potatoes in the skillet
    first, then crack the eggs over them. Set it on the burner and fry till the edges
    brown. Feeds one.'
  marginNote: Breakfast that sees you through to noon.
